<Group labelreference="L421" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Normal" layout="Normal">The <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">for..while..do</Font> structure is implemented in the following procedure, which finds the smallest prime number in a given range of integers.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L420" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">FindSmallestPrime := proc(low, high)
    local CONTINUE, i:
    CONTINUE := true:
    for i from low to high while CONTINUE do:
       if type(i, prime) then:
           print(i):
           CONTINUE := false:
       fi:
    od:
    if CONTINUE then:        print(&quot;No primes are in this range.&quot;)    fi:
end proc:</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L419" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field style="Normal" layout="Normal">In this case, the <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">while</Font> statement causes the <Font style="Maple Input" executable="false">for</Font> loop to terminate as soon as a prime number is found.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L425" drawlabel="true">
<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">FindSmallestPrime(23211432, 432450443590);
FindSmallestPrime(152, 155);</Text-field>
</Input>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="LUkjbW5HNiMvSSttb2R1bGVuYW1lRzYiSSxUeXBlc2V0dGluZ0dJKF9zeXNsaWJHRic2JFEpMjMyMTE0MzdGJy8lLG1hdGh2YXJpYW50R1Enbm9ybWFsRic=">IilQOUBC</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
<Output><Text-field style="2D Output" layout="Maple Output"><Equation executable="false" style="2D Output" display="LUkjbXNHNiMvSSttb2R1bGVuYW1lRzYiSSxUeXBlc2V0dGluZ0dJKF9zeXNsaWJHRic2I1E9Tm9+cHJpbWVzfmFyZX5pbn50aGlzfnJhbmdlLkYn">UT1Ob35wcmltZXN+YXJlfmlufnRoaXN+cmFuZ2UuNiI=</Equation></Text-field>
</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L527" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">Below is just a pure <Font mathvariant="bold" mathbackground="[255,255,255]" fontweight="bold" mathsize="12" fontfamily="Courier New" style="Maple Input" mathcolor="[120,0,14]" executable="false">while</Font><Font mathvariant="normal" mathbackground="[255,255,255]" mathsize="12" fontfamily="Times New Roman" mathcolor="[0,0,0]"> loop.</Font></Text-field>
</Input>
